    "Source data is state/district-level government aggregate statistics (area reported in hectares at regional scale, median ~9,300 ha), not per-farm records. Predictions for a single smallholder field (e.g. 1-5 ha) are an extrapolation outside the bulk of the training distribution \u2014 treat as an indicative regional outlook by crop/season/state, not a precise field-level forecast.",
